{
    "title": "TenantCloud Pro",
    "description": "TenantCloud is a comprehensive end-to-end property management system for landlords, property managers, tenants, and service providers to conveniently access and manage essential property-related information such as property details, units, leases, accounting, and maintenance requests on their phones and desktops.\r\n\r\nLandlord Account Features:\r\n\r\n- Unlimited units, listings, and properties.\r\n- Connect with tenants, owners, service professionals, and team members.\r\n- Get a customizable marketing website for your vacancies.\r\n- Get leads for your vacancies.\r\n- Set up an application fee and receive rental applications from your prospects.\r\n- Run background and credit checks right from an application.\r\n- Collect rent online.\r\n- Set up leases with the built-in document builder.\r\n- E-sign the lease and send it to your tenants to e-sign.\r\n- Automatic rent invoices, late fees, and receipts are delivered to tenants.\r\n- Store all transactions, receipts, and invoices in one place and categorize them according to your needs.\r\n- Receive, manage, and send maintenance requests to your service pros.\r\n- Build financial and rental reports in seconds and track your success.\r\n- Generate a 1099 Tax Form and send digital copies to recipients.\r\n- Sync with Google Calendar and QuickBooks.\r\n- TC Messenger for communication with tenants, service professionals, and team members.\r\n- Unlimited support.\r\n\r\nProperty Manager Account Features:\r\n\r\n- Assign a team member to every specific property.\r\n- Set their permissions for every part of the system, such as properties, listings, etc.\r\n- Keep track of all the actions of a team member saved in chronological order with the Activity History.\r\n- Connect with Owners and assign various properties to various owners under the same account.\r\n- Send Owners maintenance requests to approve repair costs.\r\n- Regulate your relationships with the agreements that can be generated within the system.\r\n- Set all the management fees, which will be calculated automatically and shown in the Accounting section.\r\n- Set up your own lease template with our Template Builder.\r\n- Communicate via TC Messenger.\r\n\r\nTenant Account Features:\r\n\r\n- Connect with your landlord and have a signed lease agreement ready in seconds.\r\n- Process rent payments easily using ACH, credit, and debit cards.\r\n- Enable Auto Pay to pay automatically on or before the due date.\r\n- Report your rent payments to the credit bureaus to build your credit score.\r\n- Maintain control over all your expenses, including rent, utilities, fees, and deposits.\r\n- Submit maintenance requests to get them fixed immediately.\r\n- Access your rental history by having all your current and past leases consolidated in one place.\r\n- Track renters insurance expiration.\r\n- Create a Renter Profile and apply online for listings.\r\n- Receive invites from landlords to view their listings based on your matching search criteria.\r\n- Keep in touch with your landlord 24/7 with the TC Messenger.\r\n\r\nService Pro Account Features:\r\n\r\n- Create a Business Profile to attract new clients.\r\n- Customize a marketing website to showcase your services.\r\n- Get notifications about new maintenance requests that appear in your area.\r\n- Make bids and get selected for the job.\r\n- Connect with the landlord and receive maintenance requests.\r\n- Manage all the maintenance requests in the app, set up your schedule, and keep track of all the work done.\r\n- Change statuses, add the materials used, and create invoices.\r\n- Manually add other maintenance requests to keep track of all orders in one place.\r\n- Get paid with ACH debit and credit cards within your TenantCloud account.\r\n- Store receipts and keep track of your payment activity all in one place.\r\n- Sync with Google Calendar.\r\n\r\nOwner Account Features:\r\n\r\n- Connect with your property managers and keep track of your properties.\r\n- Get the property reports.\r\n- Fees and distribution tools to pay property managers online.\r\n- Keep track of maintenance.\r\n- Approve maintenance request bids.\r\n- Use TC Messenger for communication.",
    "descriptionHTML": "TenantCloud is a comprehensive end-to-end property management system for landlords, property managers, tenants, and service providers to conveniently access and manage essential property-related information such as property details, units, leases, accounting, and maintenance requests on their phones and desktops.<br><br>Landlord Account Features:<br><br>- Unlimited units, listings, and properties.<br>- Connect with tenants, owners, service professionals, and team members.<br>- Get a customizable marketing website for your vacancies.<br>- Get leads for your vacancies.<br>- Set up an application fee and receive rental applications from your prospects.<br>- Run background and credit checks right from an application.<br>- Collect rent online.<br>- Set up leases with the built-in document builder.<br>- E-sign the lease and send it to your tenants to e-sign.<br>- Automatic rent invoices, late fees, and receipts are delivered to tenants.<br>- Store all transactions, receipts, and invoices in one place and categorize them according to your needs.<br>- Receive, manage, and send maintenance requests to your service pros.<br>- Build financial and rental reports in seconds and track your success.<br>- Generate a 1099 Tax Form and send digital copies to recipients.<br>- Sync with Google Calendar and QuickBooks.<br>- TC Messenger for communication with tenants, service professionals, and team members.<br>- Unlimited support.<br><br>Property Manager Account Features:<br><br>- Assign a team member to every specific property.<br>- Set their permissions for every part of the system, such as properties, listings, etc.<br>- Keep track of all the actions of a team member saved in chronological order with the Activity History.<br>- Connect with Owners and assign various properties to various owners under the same account.<br>- Send Owners maintenance requests to approve repair costs.<br>- Regulate your relationships with the agreements that can be generated within the system.<br>- Set all the management fees, which will be calculated automatically and shown in the Accounting section.<br>- Set up your own lease template with our Template Builder.<br>- Communicate via TC Messenger.<br><br>Tenant Account Features:<br><br>- Connect with your landlord and have a signed lease agreement ready in seconds.<br>- Process rent payments easily using ACH, credit, and debit cards.<br>- Enable Auto Pay to pay automatically on or before the due date.<br>- Report your rent payments to the credit bureaus to build your credit score.<br>- Maintain control over all your expenses, including rent, utilities, fees, and deposits.<br>- Submit maintenance requests to get them fixed immediately.<br>- Access your rental history by having all your current and past leases consolidated in one place.<br>- Track renters insurance expiration.<br>- Create a Renter Profile and apply online for listings.<br>- Receive invites from landlords to view their listings based on your matching search criteria.<br>- Keep in touch with your landlord 24/7 with the TC Messenger.<br><br>Service Pro Account Features:<br><br>- Create a Business Profile to attract new clients.<br>- Customize a marketing website to showcase your services.<br>- Get notifications about new maintenance requests that appear in your area.<br>- Make bids and get selected for the job.<br>- Connect with the landlord and receive maintenance requests.<br>- Manage all the maintenance requests in the app, set up your schedule, and keep track of all the work done.<br>- Change statuses, add the materials used, and create invoices.<br>- Manually add other maintenance requests to keep track of all orders in one place.<br>- Get paid with ACH debit and credit cards within your TenantCloud account.<br>- Store receipts and keep track of your payment activity all in one place.<br>- Sync with Google Calendar.<br><br>Owner Account Features:<br><br>- Connect with your property managers and keep track of your properties.<br>- Get the property reports.<br>- Fees and distribution tools to pay property managers online.<br>- Keep track of maintenance.<br>- Approve maintenance request bids.<br>- Use TC Messenger for communication.",
